  "name": "@rxap/material-table-window-system",
  "description": "Provides a directive and service to open a table select component in a window. This package allows users to select rows from a table within a window and return the selected data. It integrates with `@rxap/material-table-system` and `@rxap/window-system` for displaying and managing the table selection in a window.\n",
